window.products.push({"id":723149,"name":"Aps Paderno World Cuisine 15-Inch Round Natural Slate Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uulyv4TyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The APS Paderno World Cuisine 15\" diameter round natural slate tray is black in color and creates a unique and impressive presentation for a variety of dishes from sushi to appetizers. The natural slate retains cool temperatures extremely efficiently. Each tray is sealed with clear varnish. It is food safe, waterproof, as well as oil and liquid repellent. Note that it is not dishwasher safe. Each slate tray has skid-resistant felt pads on the underside. From the Manufacturer The APS Paderno World Cuisine 15-inch diameter round natural slate tray creates a unique and impressive presentation for a variety of dishes from sushi to appetizers. Slates, by definition, are mined directly from natural quarries. Slate has the ability to both retain cold and heat, making it ideal for serving food on buffets or tableside. They are ideal for foods such as cheeses, pates, cured meats, desserts and vegetables, as they retain cold and will keep foods fresh and appetizing. Simply place the slate/s in the refrigerator 30 minutes before serving or store them there overnight. For warm dishes, such as grilled fish, foie gras or grilled vegetables, the slates can be preheated in the oven and will retain their heat throughout the duration of the meal. In several regions in Europe, slates are used to grill fish and meat at high temperatures. Keep in mind that these slates are natural and therefore require hand washing under warm water using a sponge or a nylon kitchen brush. These slates may break if dropped. Each slate has felt pads on the underside to avoid slipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uulyv4TyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PADERNO","source_asin":"B073JYJH3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073JYJH3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073JYJH3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
