window.products.push({"id":723162,"name":"Willow Lane Home 100% Sateen Bamboo Sheets Set-Pillow Cases, Top Sheet, and Fitted Sheet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sj8BvsGjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our eco-friendly bed sheet sets are woven from 100% all-natural bamboo. Bamboo is insanely soft-as soft as cotton but more breathable, making for perfectly silky sheets. Naturally moisture-wicking, you'll feel refreshed crawling into and out of bed. Hypoallergenic, these sheets are dust-repellent and allergy-reducing so you'll stay healthy and feel fresh longer. Temperature-controlled, bamboo adjusts to the shifting temperature of your body, so you won't freeze or overheat in the middle of the night. Our sheets are tightly woven, well-constructed, and durable. Naturally wrinkle-resistant, they will keep their shape, making life that much easier. These sheets are perfect for gifting! Each set comes in a silky, reusable drawstring bag-great for weddings and showers. And caring for them is easy-throw them into the drawstring bag, and wash on cold. The bag adds an extra layer of protection for the sheets, and keeps other laundry items from getting tangled up inside. All Willow Lane Home sheet sets are available in a variety of soothing colors (White, Light Grey, Dark Grey, Sand, Steel Blue). Our Full, Queen, and King sets feature 1 fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet, and 2 pillow cases. Our Twin sheet set includes 1 fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet, and 1 pillow case.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sj8BvsGjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Willow Lane Home","source_asin":"B07HXTF7LL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HXTF7LL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HXTF7LL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
