window.products.push({"id":723183,"name":"Gizoon Full Bed Frame, Modern Platform Bed W/ 11'' Under-Bed Storage, No Box Spring Needed, Industrial Headboard W/Rivet, 13 Sturdy Metal Slat, No Noi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g4a-MIkrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙[INDUSTRIAL STYLE] The bedstead has a rich retro-industrial style. The combination of simple black metal and vintage wood grain with rivet, without too much decoration, will make the room appear more textured, less dazzling, more simple and natural. There are 2 rustic colors for your choice. 🌙[IDEAL SIZE] The standrad Full Size bed platform can perfectly fit your same size mattress. Solid iron slats are designed to support and extend the life of your latex, memory foam or innerspring mattress without the need for a box spring. 🌙[UNDER-BED STORAGE] The 11 inches under-bed space is perfect for storing clothes, towels, toys, and other extra odds and ends. It is also relatively easy to clean since the sweeper can come and go freely to help maintain a spick and span bedroom environment. 🌙[NOISE FREE& PROTECTIVE DESIGN] The non-slip thick square metal frame and sponge strip on the central support bar help reducing the noise to the maximum extent, which can help you enjoy your quiet and sweet dream. It also has a careful protective design, such as the foot pads on each support leg to prevent scratches on your floor, and the arc corner of the woodboard designed to help avoid bumps and scrapes on you. 🌙[STURDY & DURABLE] High-quality MDF board with waterproof and anti-scratch surface, 13 strong metal slats and 9 independent support legs can hold up to 800lbs capacity. Suitable for home bedroom, hotel, hostel, B&B guestroom, and other occasions. 🌙[EASY ASSEMBLY] The bed frame structure is very simple and the snap design of metal slats facilitates quick assembly, with the help of the clear instructions and the obvious mark on each part, 2 adults can complete it in 30 minutes, so you can use this retro bedstead without waiting for a long time. Everything is included in one package with required assembly tools. A professional service team is also available to help you within 24H on business days. ⚠️Attention : Mattress not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g4a-MIkrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gizoon","source_asin":"B0BSQG9V2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSQG9V2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSQG9V2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
