window.products.push({"id":723185,"name":"Silicone Baking Mat (Plain) Chef Cupid Set of 2 (Half Sheet) BPA Free Dishwasher Safe No-Slip Non Stick Waterproof Heat Resistant for Bake Pans & Roll","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uV-0dci+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Silicone Baking Mat is 100% Food Grade, BPA Free, Anti-Corrision, Odorless, and Heat Resistant up to 446°F, make your baking always safe and healthy.  Our baking mat is made of reinforced fiberglass and food grade silicone, and will hold up to the demanding use of home cooks and professional chefs. The Non-Stick Silicone Baking Mat does not required scrubbing to remove burnt sugar and fat.  Just rinse and wipe the mat clean with warm soapy water to clean it.  Our baking mat is also Dishwasher Safe, and you can placed it in the top rack of the dishwasher for cleaning. The Oven Safe, Microwave Safe Silicone Baking Mat can be used for baking foods, kneading or rolling dough, creating crispy pizza, roasting vegetable or bacon.  Our baking mat can be used in conjunction with biscuit sheets or oven trays to improve the overall air circulation and heat distribution to achieve uniform and consistent results without scorching or cooking spots. The Chef Cupid Silicone Baking Mat Set is the perfect gift for housewarming and bridal parties, weddings, birthdays, Valentines Day, Mother's and Father's Day, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas, and any other special occasion on your calendar.  Show your loved ones, family and friends how much you care for them with this practical and high quality gift that will last a lifetime. If you're not satisfied with our baking mat, we're not satisfied and we will give you a FULL REFUND or a REPLACEMENT.  Add to cart now because you have no risk.  If you have any questions about our Silicone Baking Mat Set, please feel free to contact our Customer Care, we are always at your service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uV-0dci+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHEF CUPID","source_asin":"B08RCSZHY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RCSZHY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RCSZHY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723186,"name":"Jura ENA5 Automatic Coffee and Espresso Center, Ristretto Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nU-rO+SsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy authentic crema coffee, espresso, cappuccino, and latte from the comfort of home with this fully automatic machine. Easy to use, it grinds, tamps, brews, and self cleans in under 60 seconds--all at the touch of a button. The unit's professional-grade conical steel burr grinder offers five fineness settings to accommodate individual preferences, and its separate pre-ground coffee funnel comes in handy for guests who might prefer decaf after dinner. In addition, the fully programmable machine allows for customizing the strength, temperature, and amount from 1 to 16 ounces, all of which can be easily overridden, without affecting the permanent settings, by using the rotary dial for each cup. Simply turn and push the desired function. Choose one cup, two cups, or steam, then increase or decrease the desired strength and volume. The unit supplies two frothing options--the Dual Frother Plus and the patented frothXpress system that automatically steams or froths milk into the cup. A hot-water dispenser can be used for Cafe Americano or tea. The appliance features 18 bars of pressure and a stainless-steel-lined thermoblock that heats quickly to minimize wait times before initial brewing and steaming. this Economical unit provides an innovative zero-energy switch, which ensures no standby energy consumption when turned off, and if used infrequently, its Energy Save standby mode can be switched on to reduce power consumption to an absolute minimum. Other highlights include an LCD three-color alphanumeric display, a removable 37-ounce water tank, a 7-ounce bean capacity, a rotating height-adjustable coffee spout for one or two cup preparation, automatic cleaning cycles, and a Clearyl water-filtration system that eliminates the need for decalcification. An illustrated instruction booklet, a quick reference guide, and an instructional DVD come included. With its exceptionally slim design, the bean-to-cup automatic coffee center measures 17 by 9 by 14 inches and carries a two-year limited warranty. From the Manufacturer The ENA5: A Stylish and Compact Bean-to-Cup Experience Jura-Capresso expands its new line of ENA automatic coffee centers with the ENA 5, the first Jura-Capresso model offered in three color choices: Coffee Cherry Red, Ristretto Black, and Blossom White. This stylish compact model offers a true bean-to-cup experience for crema coffee, espresso, cappuccino, latte, ristretto, and more, with more advanced features than any other ENA model. Less than 9-1/2 inches wide, the Swiss-made ENA is the world's slimmest automatic coffee center, with an intelligent space-saving design that ties into today's decor trends. The ENA 5 is first with a unique height-adjustable spout that rotates 180 degrees, giving the user the choice of brewing through a single or dual coffee spout. It is also the only model in the ENA line that comes with two frothing systems: the Dual Frother Plus for traditional frothing by injecting steam into a pitcher of milk, and the frothXpress Plus System, which automatically froths or steams milk into the cup. Energy Savings and Easy Brewing Not only does the ENA 5 offer the incomparable flavor of high-pressure-brewed crema coffee and espresso-based drinks, it has also been cited for its features for saving energy. Unlike many countertop appliances, the ENA draws no energy whatsoever when the machine is off but still plugged in. The patent-pending Smart Zero Energy Button lets the machine finish any beverage already in progress and then completely disconnects from the electrical outlet. For additional energy savings, the machine can be switched to Energy Save Standby Mode reducing power consumption up to 40 percent. Brewing is easy with the rotary dial with a built-in push button on the top of the machine. Programming the ENA is simple and intuitive, with the text display as a guide. The multi-color clear text display features easy-to-read alphanumeric text. The background is green when the machine is coffee-ready, red when action is required, and yellow in programming mode. Feature-Packed The ENA collection is the first in the Jura-Capresso line to feature a see-through bean chamber visible on top of the machine, romancing the beauty of fresh coffee beans. A built-in five-level conical burr grinder grinds the beans right before brewing for optimal taste. This high-performance grinder can be adjusted for regular or oily beans from fine to coarse simply by turning the chrome adjustment ring while the grinder is running. ENA machines can also brew pre-ground coffee for those who prefer decaffeinated or other specialty coffee blends. Like all Jura-Capresso models, the ENA collection features the patented variable-volume brewing unit, which ideally prepares between 1 and 16 ounces of coffee. Because fresh, pure water is an essential element of great coffee taste, the ENA features the CLEARYL Plus Water Filter that removes impurities and reduces scale deposits in heating elements. This filter pre","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nU-rO+SsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jura-Capresso","source_asin":"B001CS66WU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001CS66WU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001CS66WU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723187,"name":"Nautical Tropical Imports 15 Inch L Antique Brass Finish Cocktails 0700 to 0659 Daily and Sundays Plaque","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514h70VO7gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This 15\"L Antique Brass Finish Cocktails 0700 to 0659 Daily and Sundays Plaque would make a humorous addition to any room in your home. This item is made of aluminum with an antique brass finish and measures approx. 15\"L x 2.5\"H. Mounts easily to the wall using the two screw holes provided on the sides (screws are not included). Mount this item to your wall or door in your bar, beach house, or in any other nautical themed room you can imagine!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514h70VO7gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nautical Tropical Imports","source_asin":"B017Y3UV5E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017Y3UV5E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017Y3UV5E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
