window.products.push({"id":723209,"name":"Tribesigns 2-Drawer Nightstand, Set of 2, White and Gold Night Stand Bed Side Table with Metal Legs, 26'' Tall Wood White Night Stands for Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816-9okepyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IF THE DRAWERS ARE NOT ALIGNED CORRECTLY, PLEASE SWITCH THE POSITIONS OF THE UPPER AND LOWER DRAWERS. THIS WILL ENSURE THAT THEY CLOSE PROPERLY. SURPRISED BY ITS DESIGN - Founded with durable particleboard and a unique metal base, created with the white and gold two-tone look, this 2-drawer nightstand sports a modern and elegant silhouette with clean lines. This stunning bedside table is sure to draw eyes no matter where you place it in your home. 2 DRAWERS OFFER MAXIMIZED STORAGE - Two drawers give you plenty of space to host before-bed essentials while featuring elegant metal handles, open and close smoothly, to allow you easy access to your things. Use the top surface to hold a reading lamp, your favorite novel, and your glasses so everything is within easy reach. IRRESISTIBLE DETAILS CHARM - Fashionable wire splayed hairpin legs are made of metal for extra durability and style. Equipped with metal gold adjustable feet, this white and gold nightstand can withstand a spirit level test even on uneven floors. Your guests will be talking about the little details of this piece. EXTENSIVE APPLICABILITY - Dimensions: 15.75\" D x 19.7\"W x 26\"H. Not only can be used as a normal modern nightstand, bedroom cabinet, but also perfect for a sofa side table, end table, and small drawer chest. The right size makes the bedside table a perfect storage cabinet for the living room, bedroom, study, etc. CHEERS FOR THE ASSEMBLY - The white nightstand with drawers comes with numbered parts and easy-to-understand instructions for assembly in 30 mins! Enjoy lifetime professional customer service and a worry-free experience, also provide free exchange for damaged and missing parts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816-9okepyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B09V8FRW6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V8FRW6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V8FRW6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723210,"name":"Lodge CRS12 Carbon Steel Skillet, Pre-Seasoned, 12-inch & ASCRHH41 Silicone Hot Handle Holders for Carbon Steel Pans, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31c2TChIZ1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Lodge 12 Inch Seasoned Carbon Steel Skillet. Large Steel Skillet for Family Size Cooking.The American-based company Lodge has been fine-tuning its construction of rugged, cast-iron cookware for more than a century. Now lodge has added a new line of seasoned steel skillets. This handy 12-inch seasoned steel skillet is the only pre-seasoned and ready to use out of the box steel pan in the market place right now. Each skillet is pre-seasoned with natural soy bean oil. Maintains very low and very high temperatures, making the pan a highly effective and versatile cooking piece. It performs well in residential and professional kitchens as well as outdoors. Made of 12 gauge carbon steel. Steel is a high density metal that does not retain odors. If maintained correctly, it will last a lifetime. Thickness of the cooking surface allows the pan to heat up quickly but also retain the heat needed for even cooking. The handle angle is conducive for both stove top and oven cooking. Each handle is attached to the skillet with 3 secure rivets. As a result of the pre-seasoning process, you may see a blister or bubble of oil at the southern-most point or at the end of the handle of the cookware piece. The cookware is hanging as it rides through the electrostatic sprayer and commercial conveyer ovens at very high temperatures. This allows the oil to penetrate deeply into the pores of the cookware which creates an easy release finish. If visible, it will rub or flake off with your finger, leaving a brown spot. Don’t worry, it’s not rust but a seasoned spot that is brown, indicative of the varnish stage of seasoning. The brown spot will turn black with use. Made in the USA.Lodge Silicone Hot Handle Holders for Carbon Steel Pans, Red, 7\"This red silicone hot handle holders are heat-resistant and a great addition to any kitchen. Just slide the holder onto the hot handle and remove pots and pans with ease. The special silicone offers protection up to 450-Degree. Creates a safe and comfortable grip of hot cookware handles. This handle holder is flexible enough to store compactly in a drawer. Dishwasher safe. For use with Lodge Seasoned Steel Pans.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31c2TChIZ1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B006WH92A4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006WH92A4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006WH92A4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
