window.products.push({"id":723297,"name":"3 inch Round silicone Mold Half Circle for Baking,Cake,Candy,Jelly sphere molds round Chocolate Making Molds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xx6L6d7tL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Our chocolate mold is made of high-quality silicone, safe and environmentally friendly, safe to use, easy to demold, no cracks when bending, easy to restore to the original shape, and easy to store clearly. It is not easy to produce peculiar smell, and it is suitable for a wide range of occasions. It can be used for cakes. Chocolate and mousse etc. LARGE Chocolate Mold:9.96inch*6.69inch 123G SMALL Chocolate Mold:7.68inch*5.24inch 56G ☆☆☆Precautions for use☆☆☆ 1. Silicone chocolate molds can only be used in ovens, microwave ovens, dishwashers and refrigerators. Do not directly touch the open flame or close to the heat source (such as the heating tube of the toaster). It is recommended to place the mold in the middle or upper part of the oven when baking, and keep a distance of at least 5cm from the tubular heating element. 2. Wash the cake with water for the first time. Fill the cake so that it is 3/4 full. After taking it out of the oven, do not wash it with cold water immediately. After use, wash it with hot water and a dilutable edible detergent. 3. The silicone chocolate mold may be stored for a long time and be pressed = the shape changes, please put it in the sun or in the oven or high temperature to help restore the shape. 4. Do not use knives or other sharp objects on the silicone chocolate mold, and avoid pulling hard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xx6L6d7tL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TUISER","source_asin":"B08XNCMVN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XNCMVN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XNCMVN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
