window.products.push({"id":723373,"name":"D'Moksha Pure Hemp Curtains, 63 inch Sheer Curtains White, Rod Pocket Curtains 63 inch Length, Linen Curtains, 52x63 Inch White Curtains","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E3h-DFeUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HANDCRAFTED BY FINEST ARTISANS: Made from 100% pure hemp, our semi sheer curtains combine understated elegance with more than 95% protection from harmful UV rays. Extremely durable, our curtains show low color fading in the sun even after prolonged use. These curtains are crafted from the natural fabric Hemp, giving a classic natural effect the panels look aesthetic and drapes beautifully. Size - 52 x 63 Inch. One panel per box, Unlined, 3 Inch Rod Pocket and 4 Inch Bottom Hem AIRY and BREATHABLE: One of the most eco-friendly and sustainable fabrics, hemp grows organically. It consumes very little water, improves soil quality, is used as a rotation crop to improve soil fertility. Once you use it, you will love this natural fabric as much as we do. These hanging semi sheer curtains have linen like texture with the beauty of slubs. They filter the dazzling sunlight and let the soft light in while these curtains still provide you privacy. Different sizes are available. UNIQUE HOME DÉCOR: Since all our pieces are handcrafted, no two pieces are identical making every creation unique and one-of-its-kind. This means that every piece that you buy has its own special character and story. The linen design adds style and elegance to your room, provides a pretty soft and natural look to your windows, and makes your room have a more luxurious look. EASY CARE: Machine washable for easy care and maintenance, use only non-chlorine bleach when needed, tumble dry low and warm iron as needed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E3h-DFeUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D'Moksha Homes","source_asin":"B0BHVS4YYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHVS4YYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHVS4YYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723374,"name":"TINTON LIFE Funny Cake Money Box Money Pulling Cake Making Mold Food Contact Safe with Antler Topper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+UlY4XyqL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Features: 1.SAFE MATERIAL: Food grade 3.9\" x 3.9\" x 1.1\" plastic box, food contact safe. Hand wash ONLY, not dishwasher safe. 2.BIG SURPRISE: This money pulling cake making mold is perfect for creating unforgettable memories for family or friends. Your cakes will be a big hit to the party! 3.PACKAGE INCLUED:1 money box,1 cake topper and 10 transparent bags- CASH IS NOT INCLUDED.Great For Birthdays, Weddings, Holidays, Anniversaries, Graduation and other events. 4.APPLY:The money box is for the money pulling cake. Cake with Money inside will Surprise your love ones! Perfect gift for your loveones. 5.USAGE METHOD: Like picture shows. Put money in this box and then put it into cakes. The best idea if you want to give money as a gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+UlY4XyqL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TINTON LIFE","source_asin":"B07MNJBTKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MNJBTKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MNJBTKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723375,"name":"SEMECH Pinch Pleat Comforter Queen Size, Microfiber Bedding Comforter Sets Queen Size, 3 Piece Ivory Queen Comforter Set Lightweight, (Champagne Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ySFMdp87L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT & WARM: Made from ultra-soft microfiber fabric shell with a 250gsm filling, SEMECH pinch pleat comforter set is everything you need for a peaceful night’s sleep. Microfiber has a nice thermal ability which will bring you exceptional softness and comfort in cold winter. Wrapping yourself in this premium bedding comforter set after the day's exhaustion, you will feel relaxed and sleep soundly all night long. ALL-SEASON COMFORT: The queen comforter set is warm but lightweight which meets your requirements in all seasons. In the cold winter, the ivory comforter set featuring thick and warm fiber holds the perfect amount of warmth for your most restful night's sleep. While in the rest of the months, the proper weight it offers will allow you to toss and turn freely without overheating. LUXURIOUS DESIGN: The exquisite pinch pleat dotted on our queen size bedding set as well as chic straps at the corners is a perfect way to fresh up your bedroom decor. The ivory comforter set queen size subtly blends sophistication and understated, adding a touch of glamour to your space. Even if you have used it for long years, you won’t be bored with it. EASY CARE: The ivory bedding comforter set is easy to clean. Machine wash in cold water on gentle cycle and tumble dry low. Do not rub, twist, expose, iron or bleach for long years of warmth and comfort. It is recommended to wash separately or together with clothing of similar colors. We are glad to answer any questions about our pinch pleat comforter set, do not hesitate to connect us. PINCH PLEAT COMFORTER SET: Each queen bedding comforter set consists of one comforter (88\"x88\") and two matching pillow shams (20\"x26\"). No matter what the main color of your bedroom is, you can choose the right one from 4 solid colors. This queen size comforter set is a top gift for kids, parents, and friends of all ages on special holidays such as birthdays or Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ySFMdp87L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEMECH","source_asin":"B09C5CKG19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C5CKG19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C5CKG19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
