window.products.push({"id":723495,"name":"Harold Import Company, Inc. Helen Chen's Asian Kitchen, Set of 20 Parchment Steamer Liner, Medium, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rKFqVM8QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Helen’s Asian Kitchen Steamer Liners keep foods from sticking to bamboo and metal steamers, and air fryers, without adding oils. Made from natural parchment paper, these liners are heat safe to 400-degrees Fahrenheit and can be used in the freezer, microwave, and for lining the bottom of air fryers. Perforations in the paper allow steam and hot air to circulate freely around foods. Use them when steaming vegetables and fish, making dim sum, dumplings, breads, warming tortillas, and more. Simply line the inside of the steamer or air fryer with the parchment round and place foods on top. Line larger steamers with 2 or more liners. Single use and disposable for easy cleanup and fully biodegradable. Not intended for use with direct flame. Do not use for broiling or grilling. Brought to you by HIC-Harold Import Company. Amazon.com Offered by Helen's Asian Kitchen, these parchment steamers are a smart kitchen item that simultaneously improves cooking results and speeds cleanup. Designed to work with bamboo or metal steamers, the liners keep doughy items like dumplings from sticking to the sides of the steamer. They are heat-resistant and include perforations so steam circulation is uninhibited. Packaged here in a set of 20, the liners can also be layered in larger steamers and used for reheating. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rKFqVM8QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B09C147VK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C147VK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C147VK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
