window.products.push({"id":723598,"name":"Reusable Ziplock Bags Silicone, Leakproof Reusable Freezer Bags, BPA Free Reusable Food Storage Bags for Lunch Marinate Food Travel, 4 Gallon 4 Snack ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k8uFLTs6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[SAFE MATERIAL & REUSABLE FOOD STORAGE BAGS] WONDAY reusable storage bags are made of PEVA material which is BPA-free. Double-lock zipper design provides an air tight seal to ensure they are waterproof and hygienic to ideal for storing food. We provide 1 rack for air dry and 3 different sizes storage bags: 4 x Reusable Gallon Bags are 10.7 x 11 inch, 4 x Reusable Sandwich Bags are 10.2 x 7.8 inch, 4 x Reusable Snack Bags are 8.5 x 7 inch. [LEAK PROOF & KEEP FOOD FRESH] The reusable freezer bags featured with double zipper closures locks are leak proof, easier to open and close, the airtight seal zipper avoid spilling liquid objects and prevent the odor of different foods from mixing. It is very convenient for you to sort and store different foods.They are easy to fold and store to reduce the space required. Perfect for kitchen, picnics and travel. [FREEZER SAFE & MULTI-PURPOSE] These reusable storage bags are freezer safe.They will protect your food and preserve the original taste of food.Perfect for freezing meat,fish and vegetables. Suitable for sandwich bags, snack bags, lunch bags, travel bags.The transparent design can help you view quickly what's inside the reusable storage bags. You can use them to store food, snack, fruit, makeup and so on. [EASY TO CLEAN & REDUCE POLLUTION] The reusable clear bread bags is easy to clean after using, clean with the bottle brush and put the bags on the top of the rack to air dry.For the safety of family and the earth, we should use more environment and durable sandwich bags and snack bags rather than using plastic bags. One reusable bag can replace up to 400 disposable plastic bags.Reduce the using plastic bags, not only can protect our earth, but also save our money. [MORE CAPACITY & GOOD SERVICE] We are very willing to adopt customer suggestions. Compared with other reusable food bags on the market, we have increased the capacity of medium and small reusable food bags so that you can store more fruits or snacks.The reusable sandwich bags you buy will also come with a drying rack. your fullest satisfaction is our top priority. If you are not happy with the purchase, do let us know. We refund or offer an exchange to ensure you become part of WONDAY family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k8uFLTs6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WONDAY","source_asin":"B0B9SCYXTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9SCYXTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9SCYXTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
