window.products.push({"id":723651,"name":"DeLonghi XU650 Alfredo Ultima 6-Slice Toaster Oven, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ST1HG34YL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com For the whole family, a countertop toaster oven is indispensable. This handsome, compact unit (16-1/2 inches wide, including handles, by 9 inches high by 11 inches deep) toasts six slices of bread for breakfast, broils Junior's burger and Dad's steak, toasts Sis's sandwich, bakes Mom's cake and meat loaf, and heats frozen pizzas while everyone watches television. Inside it's enameled porcelain for even heating. Included is a wire rack that slides into two positions and holds a baking-broiling pan, which comes with a broiling rack, and a thermostat dials up temperatures from \"keep warm\" to 470 degrees to \"toast.\" Another dial controls toasting from \"light\" to \"dark, \" and a third dial, with \"broil\" or \"bake/toast\" settings, turns on top and bottom heating elements. Wire rack, pan, and the broiling rack go in the dishwasher, while the interior, exterior, and glass door wipe clean with soapy water. An instruction booklet tells all. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ST1HG34YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B00004RGAP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004RGAP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004RGAP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723652,"name":"EdgeMod Trattoria Kitchen and Dining Metal Side Chair in White (Set of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-t-Ut7ukL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Some things never go out of style, and such is the case with our classic Trattoria Side Chair. Perfect for your industrial-inspired dining or living space, this chair delivers endless durability and inviting style. The chair includes non-marking feet caps to protect your flooring and lend stability. Built in powder-coated iron, it’s astoundingly sturdy. Featuring tapering legs and a rounded back frame, this chair is easy to stack and store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-t-Ut7ukL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EdgeMod","source_asin":"B01LJDTV7O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LJDTV7O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LJDTV7O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723653,"name":"LIDORE 100 LED Green Grape String Lights. 10 Cluster Lights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Aoqd9jtwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Benefits of String Lights String lights, in contrast, can be simply unwound or otherwise detached from their surface to be quickly moved. String lights are also fun because they call attention to the light bulbs themselves. String lights are front and center, as if delighting the viewer is a high priority. That makes string lighting slightly more fun and carefree.  How to Use Outdoor String Lights  Patio string lights have become very popular over the past decade, festooning across outdoor areas in this apparent renaissance of bohemian design. If you want to transform your patio into a more relaxing zone perfect for a glass of wine on a summer night (or a cup of cocoa by the chiminea in the winter), patio string lights are a great option. Commercial string lights and globe string lights are popular for use for the patio, and the two most popular applications are wrapping and hanging. In combination, wrapped and hung outdoor string lights give a cohesive look and very even lighting. No other type of light fixture can be so easily strung around its environment of deck railings, posts, arbors, and trees.  Holiday String Lights During the holiday season, string lights get to see a lot of action. From the garlands on the mantle, to the tree inside, to the bushes and branches outside, string lights become part of the family. You may have family traditions that determine where and how these lights will be displayed. Or you might be on the hunt for new DIY holiday light projects that involve string lights. The point is that they can be used in many different ways during the holidays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Aoqd9jtwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIDORE","source_asin":"B0899WVY5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0899WVY5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0899WVY5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
