window.products.push({"id":723657,"name":"SE 3\" Alumina Ceramic Pot - CI124DT","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ui+3hfEZL._AC_SL1110_.jpg","description":"The SE 3” Alumina Ceramic Pot is ideal for melting gold, copper, silver, and brass with a torch. This white pot is best handled with crucible tongs, which are not included. This product is great for gold miners and you use it to settle materials down. It features a convenient pour spout to easily remove the material. SE is committed to providing the customer with the best source for value possible on the market. You will enjoy the quality, function and usefulness of our SE 3” Alumina Ceramic Pot. IPR Rights Notice: Important: Avoid getting counterfeit items. Genuine SE products come with the SE logo on the packaging. SE is a registered trademark protected by US Trademark Law.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ui+3hfEZL._AC_SL1110_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SE","source_asin":"B0093E1NJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0093E1NJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0093E1NJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723658,"name":"Phantoscope Set of 2 New Living Series Decorative Dahlia Blue Throw Pillow Case Cushion Cover 18\" x 18\" 45cm x 45cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fAuNx147L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate your bed or couch with a cushion in this Case, and augment the unique style of your room in an instant! Made from quality Material, the case is lightweight and durable, and allows you to comfortably hold, lean against or rest on your cushion. The case is sure to add flavor, texture and depth to your living space. Your cushion in this case will also look great on the dresser or even in the car. This cushion case is safe to machine wash, so you're always free to change up the design once in a while as well. Best Throw Pillow for Home Decor, Large, Soft, for Adults & Kids, Great for Bedroom & Lounges - the cheapest Throw Pillow on the Market that is Comfortable, Sturdy & Won't Pop,100% Satisfaction Guarantee!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fAuNx147L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Phantoscope","source_asin":"B071CZYVKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071CZYVKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071CZYVKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723659,"name":"PALM TREE TRIVET/PLAQUE -sliceNEW!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31i3lBBNfjL._AC_.jpg","description":"Take a look at this BRAND NEW 3-Dimensional Palm Tree TRIVET/PLAQUE. This is a really cute piece to display on a kitchen counter top, oven, or wall. The Trivet/Plaque shows palm trees on a Round shape. They are embossed / 3-D. The colors are nice and bright!! The Trivet/Plaque measures approx. 8\" Round. There is a very fine gloss finish coating the fine ceramic which makes this beautiful piece. This would make a great addition to your kitchen decor or a wonderful gift for any PALM TREE LOVER! Please don't forget to take a look at our many other palm tree design items of this same design set and other styles. Thanks for looking! =)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31i3lBBNfjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KMC/KK-PalmTree","source_asin":"B001G51ZB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001G51ZB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001G51ZB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723660,"name":"Department 56 Christmas Traditions Santa Gingerbread Sleigh Figurine Set, 10.5 Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mq81AeYeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed in the US, every Possible Dreams Santa is hand-made by a team of skilled artisans. Individually sculpted with unique facial expressions and poses, personality and sometimes humor - no two Santa's are the same! Each piece is painted and assembled with intricate detail and artistic expertise. Our signature stiffened fabric, mixed media, bottom stamp and brass tag certifies an authentic Possible Dreams Santa. Santa holds a gingerbread cookie he is about to put into the Gingerbread Sleigh. About Department 56: For 40 years, Department 56 has been creating holiday traditions passed down from generation to generation. The excitement of the holiday season comes home with intricately detailed villages from settings that inspire the imagination. Stroll through a small American town, enjoy a walk with Charles Dickens, or visit Santa in the North Pole. Our ornaments and figurines create even more opportunities to spread good wishes during the happiest time of the year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mq81AeYeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B08THY5DKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08THY5DKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08THY5DKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723661,"name":"Poultry Shrink Bags with Labels, Zip Ties, & Silicone Straw to Keep Chicken, Turkey, & Other Meat Fresh Longer – Food-Safe Sealer Bags by OPTIONP, 13x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OK10Qp8AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Save Poultry Better and Longer With These Heat Sealing BagsFreezing poultry in generic bags does sustain its freshness, yet inevitable air leakage limits the time span and diminishes the food’s quality. Keep your small game fresher, longer with OPTIONP! Your innovative heat shrink bags lock in the delicious flavor, texture, and nutrients of your chicken, turkey, duck, rabbit by being completely airtight. Seal and sustain with OPTIONP!Discover Your Complete, Chicken-Saving KitEquip your kitchen for poultry-sustaining success with OPTIONP’s 151 pc. set. This professional quality, this bulk set is perfect for home cooks or licensed butchers. Enjoy:– 50 clear shrink bags (13x18 in.), each holding 10-14 lbs.– 50 food container labels to record the chicken’s packaging date, weight, and cost.– 50 clear zip ties– 1 reusable silicone straw for the sealing processSimple Steps for Long-Lasting ResultsWith your chicken bag set, a few simple steps ensure enduring freshness. To seal your poultry or small animal meat:1. Place the chicken/poultry headfirst into the bag.2. Insert the silicone straw into the bird’s cavity.3. Twist the bag closed around the straw, securing it with a zip tie.4. Dip the bag in hot water (185-200°F) for 3-5 seconds.5. Remove the bag, pull the straw out, and tighten the zip tie.6. Slap on a label sticker, record the poultry’s particulars, and freeze or sell!A Bunch of Additional BenefitsReap the perks of premium design!– skip cheaply made bags that rip easily. Your turkey shrink bags for freezer resist ripping and tearing thanks to their high-quality PA/PE and 50mic thickness.– Save with assurance in your food-safe ,BPA-free bags.– Crafted clear material, your bags look professional and allow easy assessment.Don’t let your poultry spoil prematurely. Preserve it by adding OPTIONP’s shrink bag set to your cart!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OK10Qp8AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OPTIONP","source_asin":"B08N5XVFZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N5XVFZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N5XVFZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
