window.products.push({"id":723678,"name":"Homestia 6Pcs Metal Cocktail Picks for Drinks, Gothic Skull Martini Picks Olive Martini Picks Cocktail Accessories for Drinks, 4.7\" Retro Art Deco Coc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dOshyy3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ART DECOR FINIAL: Set of 6 stainless steel martini sticks with our original solid 3D sculptures. These 4.7\" martini olive skewers are long enough to hold 3-4 Rey large olives. Vintage cocktail drink garnishes, with strong but low-key style, great additions to home bar cart or liquor cabinet. QUALITY STEEL MATERIAL: Our metal cocktail picks are made of 306(18/8) food-grade stainless steel, head in zinc alloy. Anti-corrosive, unbreakable and rustproof, with sturdy crafts and longer service life. Reusable garnish picks for cocktails could elevate your homemade alcoholic beverages and enhance your party vibe, serve and impress your guests. MULTIPURPOSE COCKTAIL STICKS: The metal cocktail picks for appetizers are a must-have for professional bartenders. The garnish strung with cocktail sticks will be the finishing touch to the liquor drinks and symbolize the end of your bartending. The metal toothpicks can be used for fondue savoyarde, thick sandwiches, or serve your guest with classic Italian appetizer. DISTINCTIVE GIFT CHOICE: The cocktail skewers for drinks come in different themed collections, heavy-duty garnish picks for cocktails with retro ends is absolutely a surprising gift for Birthday, Christmas, Easter, Halloween or Father's Day. Bring this martini accessoires to add an extra layer of elegance to your soirée. WARRANTY: NOT DISHWASHER SAFE, RECOMMENDED TO WASH BY HAND. If there is any problem with the items (quality, function, etc.), we are accepted unconditional return, feel free to contact our 24-hour customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dOshyy3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homestia","source_asin":"B07P1B6C5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P1B6C5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P1B6C5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723679,"name":"Shimmer Shag Beige 18\" Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ShXusYe8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you call them shiny, shimmery, plush, lush, or sumptuous, the Shimmer Shag Pillow is definitely soooooft! The ideal choice for kids to roll around with, to make a funky statement in a dorm room, or to accent a new baby’s room, the Shimmer Shag Pillow is handmade using natural cotton and polyester fibers. By using this unique combination of fibers, we've created a pillow that literary sparkles! This beige single sided plush pillow has over 1.5 inch deep pile. The backing is made of cotton with hidden zipper closure and filled with siliconized polyester.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ShXusYe8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shimmer Shag","source_asin":"B01E7N29RW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E7N29RW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E7N29RW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":723680,"name":"Roy Lei Cream Blackout Curtains for Bedroom Living Room Window, Black Out Thermal Curtains & Drapes, Grommet Solid Thermal Insulated Soundproof Curtai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iv2HJMVtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let’s face it: we can all use more sleep. We’re always trying to find ways to get more, make our sleep better, or remedy ourselves from sleep deprivation. Luckily, if you can’t get the sleep you really need on a regular basis, you can improve the quality of what you get so you will be more alert when you wake up. Putting up blackout curtains will help keep out the bright sun that can wake you up too early.In addition to keeping the early morning light out, blackout curtains are a must if you work night shift too. And if you live in a city where you can see your neighbors directly outside your window, the thicker your curtains, the better so you can have more privacy.Having a thermal blackout curtain is ideal for your home as it may help you save on energy costs. By having a thermal blackout curtain, it can reduce the amount of heat lost during the colder months, and reflect heat during the warmer months resulting in a decreased amount of money spent. While a thermal blackout curtain won’t do all the work for you, it’s a great start if you plan on making your home more sustainable and .Available in basically every color, you can match it to your decor. If you want a classic blackout curtain to give you sweeter dreams or maximum privacy, these ones will do the trick. They feature a grommet design and come in different sizes so it can fit your window size. There is a variety of colors to choose from so you can customize your look without sacrificing style.When hanging your curtain, you’d want to make sure that you’re hanging it in the most appropriate room. With thermal blackout curtains, they work best in rooms that are the most exposed to natural sunlight. Not only will they help to minimize the light that penetrates through, it’ll also help to dampen sound, and keep you well-insulated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iv2HJMVtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roy Lei","source_asin":"B09J3D1TPZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J3D1TPZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J3D1TPZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
