window.products.push({"id":723682,"name":"uxcell Stretch Sofa Cover Printed Couch Covers, 1 Piece Slipcover with Plum Flower Pattern for Sofas Loveseat Armchair, Furniture for Living Room with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I0XwuPf4L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Our sofa cover / loveseat cover and chair cover are made by form fitting stretch fabric.This sofa slipcover will perfect to your sofa / loveseat and chair from etc. This sofa covers not only your furniture ensuring it lasts for years to come, but also add luxurious new look or refresh your existing home decor. Sofa size between:-Small Back Length 35-51In/90-130cm Approx-Medium Back Length 57-72In/145-185cm Approx-Large Back Length 69-86In/175-220cm Approx-X-Large Back Length 88-114In/225-290cm Approx1 Free cushion cover size: 17 to 17 Inches( without the pillow inner)2. Normally, slipcover size should be slightly larger than the sofa size. How to install:Steps 1: Position the slipcover over the sofa with the label at the backSteps 2: Pull the fabric evenly over the sofa, and push white sponge cylinders in spaces between the cushions, shaping the cover to the sofa and keeping fabric tightSteps 3: Tilt the sofa up and find elastic ties. Pull the front and back ties together tightly and tie. Pull the side ties together and tightlySteps 4: Put the sofa down and pll cover tight, pulling any excess fabric to the backSteps 5: Enjoy your newly coverd sofa! Warm prompt:-Due to the different size of the sofa gap, the foam pieces may sometimes not work very well when the gap is too big or too small.If too small, we suggest that you can just put some waste clothes or towels in to the gap and do not need to use the foam pieces.If too big, it will be better when you put waste clothes or towels in to the sofa gap with these foam pieces","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I0XwuPf4L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uxcell","source_asin":"B08HQ3LWTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HQ3LWTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HQ3LWTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
