window.products.push({"id":723847,"name":"UGOS Organic Beeswax Food Wraps Roll - Reusable Bees Wax Paper Wrap (Bees Roll)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AUcpUMD2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you getting started on your zero-waste journey? Sure, plastic wraps save your sandwiches, but they pollute the planet at the same time. Because most of these products are created for single use, they end up in our oceans and impact our wildlife after they are thrown away. It’s a good thing that many families have started cutting down on plastic consumption. With more and more households doing away with the use of this non-biodegradable material in their homes, you’re now inspired to do the same. With Ugos Beeswax Food Wraps, you save both your food and the environment! Our reusable wraps are an earth-friendly way to store leftovers without leaching toxic chemicals into them. The beeswax and Jojoba oil we use have natural properties that keep your food fresher for longer, while the tree resin helps the wrap cling to itself. Wrap a bowl, half a fruit, cheese, or just about anything you like! You can even fold these beeswax food wraps into pouches or envelopes to hold your snacks and treats. Just make sure not to store seafood, poultry or raw meat in these beeswax wrapping sheets. This convenient set of beeswax food wrap comes in 1 Meter Roll (13” x 39”)   The packaging is specifically made from 100% recycled paper. Here are more reasons to love our planet-friendly food keepers: ✅ Coated with enough beeswax to ensure they adhere well to bowls and mason jars ✅ Great alternative to stasher bags, aluminum foils and plastic cling wraps ✅ Thoughtful housewarming gift Go for the natural alternative to plastic wrappers. Add Ugos Beeswax Food Wraps to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AUcpUMD2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UGOS","source_asin":"B08F7GX9CR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7GX9CR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7GX9CR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
