window.products.push({"id":723898,"name":"20 Bundles Artificial Flowers,[5 Colors] Fake Flowers,[Waterproof] Artificial Plants & Flowers Outdoor Indoor, Hydrangea Silk Flowers Heads No Fade Fa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Mje4YC9LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌼【Silk Flower Head】:Our fake flower heads are made of silk screen silk cloth.The flower piece adopts advanced embossing technology to make the shape more layered. Flower piece will not be deformed and waterproof. The color of the flower adopts European-style tones, has a more realistic decorative effect. 【Outdoor & Indoor decor】:Our lifelike artificial flowers add a charming charm to your front porch, backyard, walkway, patio, farmhouse, garden, balcony, window sill, home, offices, dinning room table, outside or indoor.Makes your outdoor indoor hanging baskets pop with bright beautiful colors. 【Close to Nature】: Faux flowers are very realistic looking,fresh and vibrant , bring the lush and bright color of the nature into your home. Mix it with other fresh flowers plants and no one will know the difference! Of course if you are paying very close attention you can tell they are not real, but otherwise you will think they are. Even the little leaves have great details when examining everything up close. They have sturdy stems at the base as well. 【More Durable】 :An upgraded version of ordinary flower heads and leaves,add stronger branches.The new artificial flower head is stronger and not easy to fall off(adjustable). More stable in outdoor decoration. Don't worry about the wind making it fall over. 【Save Your Time】: If you cant keep real plants alive so this is a great alternative. The uniqueness of artificial outdoor plants is that you don’t need to worry about sunlight, watering, pruning or other maintenance. No matter where you display these artificial flowers, you won’t have to worry about it withering.perfect for people who have a busy schedule but love flowers. 💕【WHAT'S IN THE PACKAGE】:20 Bundles super value set, 5 Colors in total, and 3 bundles of each color there are red, pink, yellow, white, and purple. Rich color, fresh and natural.They offer true-to-life petal and foliage textures. Our philosophy is to serve every customer. Whatever the issue you meet, feel free to contact us to find a satisfying solution. We provide 36 Months warranty and lifetime support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Mje4YC9LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BoxelFOS","source_asin":"B0BFPC34QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-723898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFPC34QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFPC34QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
